    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;be a function which satisfies&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>, for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>, is",
